{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026a4jHkula3b1795760910.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一艘由上環往深圳蛇口的客輪，在青衣油庫對出撞到船塢設施，22人受傷，其中5人情況嚴重。</p><p></p><p>涉事客輪「新迅隆貳號」事發後被拖到青衣友聯船廠，船頭撞至凹陷，近看可見到油漆剝落，船頭大量物品被撞跌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.SHIP-1300-1_CLEAN_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202624ypoj85n71795756382.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方上午約九時半接報，一艘由上環往蛇口的客輪，至青衣油庫對出懷疑撞到船塢設施。大批救護人員趕到現場，消防亦出動消防船協助，用擔架將傷者從船上救出，有傷者要戴上頸箍。傷者全部清醒，送往瑪嘉烈醫院及仁濟醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.SHIP-1300-1_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EA111AuImw1795756403.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>涉事客輪為高速雙體客輪，由深圳招商迅隆船務營運。來往上環港澳碼頭至蛇口的航線，原定航程大約一小時。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:43:53.683198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:05:51.694866+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:15.677782+00:00","content_hash":"38acc1625e3e07bc5c7696f290911c7d6fcf8d70d9f1db374c42d27398295510","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:43:53.683198+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}